      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## TPS Color Match test (balloon)\n\nA large object filling half the mask. Without the match the pasted sky and the left half of the face come out darker; with it, they match. A plain color match over the cut would be pulled off by the red balloon.\n\n**Run it**, then compare:\n- **no match | color match** - the edit pasted as it came, and after TPS Color Match.\n- **measure_view** - where color was measured (green band, red = what the edit changed, orange = changed outside the mask), the plateau before and after (red = edit darker, blue = brighter), the fitted grade, confidence and warnings.\n- **change_mask** - what the edit changed, in cut space, found without a fixed threshold.\n\n**Try:** `color` grade + edge / grade / edge / off, `edge_profile` and `edge_width`, `texture`, `grade_strength`; TPS Paste `feather_detail` keep / plain. Bypass TPS Color Match (Ctrl+B) to see the edit unmatched.\n\nTPS Cut `size_multiple` 32 and the encoder's `resolution` 0 keep the cut at its own size. Qwen Image 2.1 shifts pixels by a few px; `align` full pulls the edit back first. The text encoder is `qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot`; no prompt enhancer.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Read me"
    }
  ],
